OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear intervals in the evening.
OL,7,FStaying mostly dry overnight with
OL,8,Fclear spells, allowing some mist and
OL,9,Ffog patches to form. Rather cold.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FAny isolated mist and fog
OL,12,Fsoon clearing to a dry day with long
OL,13,Fsunny spells before clouding over
OL,14,Ftowards the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,17,Fwith rain early Friday clearing to
OL,18,Fmostly dry conditions and sunny
OL,19,Fspells. Spells of heavy rain over the
OL,20,Fweekend with winds strengthening and
OL,21,Fbringing a risk of gales.
